WEBVTT

00:00:29.156 --> 00:00:33.476
I was horrified that Canada's
old-growth forests are being logged.

00:00:33.516 --> 00:00:34.676
They're burning.

00:00:34.716 --> 00:00:37.716
They're being destroyed
by beetle infestations.

00:00:38.036 --> 00:00:43.076
But also because so much
of the forest is under threat

00:00:43.116 --> 00:00:45.036
because of what lies under it.

00:00:45.756 --> 00:00:46.916
Oil.

00:00:48.196 --> 00:00:49.356
At the time,

00:00:49.396 --> 00:00:52.636
I thought that Canada's failure
to reduce emissions

00:00:52.636 --> 00:00:55.276
was because we had a government

00:00:55.316 --> 00:00:57.796
that just didn't believe
in climate change.

00:00:58.636 --> 00:01:02.116
But then in 2015,
we elected a new government.